{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/a5bd998aa337faab039c61078da4c648.avif?t=1725546623\" width=616 height=246 /></span><br><br><strong>Ukko &amp; Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound</strong> is a charming puzzle game for all ages, transporting you into a magical connection between a reindeer and a maned wolf. By controlling one character at a time, you alternate between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 through a mystical link with a falling star to solve various challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><br>\u2022\t<strong>Stunning Environments:</strong> Explore the lush subtropical climate of Guar\u00e1 and the icy Nordic environment of Ukko. Switch between these unique worlds to uncover mysteries and overcome challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/ea3348bbba0d95ba0f8027b3aba930c5.avif?t=1725546623\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Cooperative and Non-Violent Gameplay:</strong> There are no enemies to fight. The focus is on the magical cooperation and friendship between the protagonists.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/216b8420228bc335e59bd8b25f90af77.avif?t=1725546623\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Magical Interaction:</strong> Discover how to use different interactive objects and utilize weather changes to complete puzzles. Cast the star between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 to solve enigmas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.poster.avif?t=1725546623\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c